    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Senior filmmaker and photographer, London-based (Birmingham-born), Jamaican-British heritage. Approx. 8 years professional trajectory; started via BBC university placement, now directs top commercial campaigns (Louis Vuitton, Chanel, Dior, Prada, Nike, Apple, Burberry) and music videos (Kendrick Lamar, Jorja Smith, Snoop Dogg, Lady Gaga). Short film The Thread won Special Prize at 2026 Berlinale; Young Guns 18 winner; Ad Age Director to Watch. Represented commercially by Smuggler (Europe); also by Phenomena for photography. Operates as independent represented director, Freelance confirmed across Smuggler, BWGTBLD, Phenomena, ItsNiceThat. Autonomy 4: delivers finished films and editorial photography independently at senior level within a commercial director representation model. Sources: smugglersite.com, phenomena.photos, itsnicethat.com, dazeddigital.com, bwgtbld.tv.",
